t.json with schema:\n   {\"band\":[310,319],\"reviewed\":[...],\"findings\":[{\"adr\",\"status_before\",\"status_after\",\"action\",\"reason\",\"higher_adrs_cited\"}],\"files_changed\":[],\"no_change\":[]}\n7) Return summary: band, n_reviewed, n_changed, list of changes one line each.\n\nHard stops: no secrets; no *.generated.json; no force-push; no changes outside docs/decisions/ for this band (+ receipt under _disposition/).\n",
    label: "band-0310",
    capability_mode: "all",
    agent_type: "general-purpose",
});
